sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Solicitante (sk)
  participant R as Receiver
  participant M as Manager
  participant DB as SSOT (schema ipm)
  participant P as Publisher
  participant REC as Reconciler
  participant OB as Observer
  participant EX as Executor
  participant ST as Banco platform (schema ipm)
  U->>R: POST /v1/ipm/groups {organizationId, name, description, roles}
  R->>R: valida token, permissão ipm.group.create, escopo na Organization, bind e cota
  R->>M: requested-create (REQUESTED)
  R-->>U: 202 resourceId e operationId
  M->>DB: Group present (Pending), Operation accepted, outbox desired
  P->>DB: lê o outbox pendente, em ordem
  P->>REC: desired (DESIRED)
  P->>OB: desired (DESIRED)
  OB->>ST: SELECT em ipm.group e ipm.group_role
  OB->>REC: observed absent (OBSERVED)
  OB->>M: observed absent (fase Reconciling, Operation in_progress)
  REC->>EX: action create (ACTION)
  EX->>EX: revalida a ação contra o desired vigente
  EX->>ST: transação: upsert em ipm.group e ipm.group_role
  EX->>REC: completed (RESULT)
  EX->>OB: completed (RESULT)
  OB->>ST: lê o grupo de novo
  OB->>REC: observed present (OBSERVED)
  OB->>M: observed present com causationId = actionId
  M->>DB: fase Ready, observed_generation = 1, Operation completed
  P->>U: updated Ready (UPDATED)
